Motions (assets/moves.bin)
==========================

The skeleton and the motions Freedie moves by are sampled from the "Universal Animation
Library" and "Universal Animation Library 2" (Standard), by Quaternius, released under
Creative Commons Zero (CC0 1.0 Universal, public domain dedication).

  Source:  https://quaternius.com/packs/universalanimationlibrary.html
           https://quaternius.com/packs/universalanimationlibrary2.html
  License: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Changes made: the finger bones were left out; 25 of the motions were chosen and renamed,
sampled at 30 frames a second as each bone's turn and place in the figure's own space, and
the figure turned to face the other way. No mesh of theirs is used: the figure is built of
the game's own blocks. CC0 asks for no credit; it is given here all the same.

Everything else in this project stays under the terms in LICENSE.
